<title>SPAIN: Spain's BCH sold 9.20 pct of Aumar.</title>
<headline>Spain's BCH sold 9.20 pct of Aumar.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's Banco Central Hispano (BCH) has sold another 9.20 percent of motorway concession Autopistas del Mare Nostrum (Aumar), a statement said.</p>
<p>The Spanish bank sold 6,138,690 shares at 2,100 pesetas.</p>
<p>By 0930 GMT on Monday, Aumar's shares were trading at 2,060 pesetas.</p>
<p>In February BCH sold 5.92 percent of Aumar shares, selling around 3.9 million shares for a total value of 8.4 billion pesetas.</p>
<p>BCH now holds around three percent of Aumar stock.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
